  "body": "Auction: on site on Saturday 12 December 2026 at 12:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nWhat began as a humble holiday retreat in the 1960's has evolved into an exceptional coastal property offering space, character and versatility in one of Orewa’s most desirable locations.\r\n\r\nSet on a generous 890sqm (more or less) level site, the current owners have thoughtfully transformed the property into something truly special. Two beautifully renovated and extended homes sit alongside a third home, built just six years ago, complemented by a separate studio and two internal garages. A stand-alone garage and workshop at the rear of the property preserves a touch of its original character.\r\n\r\nHamptons-inspired styling flows throughout, with quality finishes and workmanship evident at every turn. Each home has its own character, offering spacious interiors, privacy, tranquillity and effortless living just moments from the beach.\r\n\r\nPositioned at the quiet northern end of Orewa and surrounded by mature trees, this is coastal living at its best. A pedestrian walkway beside Alice Eaves Bush Reserve leads through Arundel Reserve towards the beach, with historic Orewa House and Walnut Cottage Café close by. The vibrant Orewa shopping and restaurant precinct is an easy, flat walk away, while motorway access via Orewa Heights makes commuting simple.\r\n\r\nWhether you’re accommodating extended family, seeking a beachside lifestyle with rental income, or securing a versatile investment for the future, this is an opportunity worth exploring. Zoned Mixed Housing Urban, this unique property offers exciting possibilities for a range of buyers.\r\n\r\nProperties offering this combination of location, flexibility and multiple dwellings are rarely available.\r\n\r\nWe invite you to view at our next open home or arrange a private appointment. Get in touch today to discover the possibilities.",
